      "id": "claim_5a6bc839d5e24aa5915a3b23fd3f7d77",
      "statement": "Vercel AI Gateway (https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh) is the single outbound AI surface for Claude Code in the sandbox, wired by writing ~/.config/claude/config.json with api_key, api_base_url:'https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh', and default_model:<selectedModel || 'claude-sonnet-4-5'>, and by prefixing every claude invocation with ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY and ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh.",
