      "statement": "The OpenAI Codex CLI is configured to route through Vercel AI Gateway (https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1) only when the AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY begins with 'vck_'; the codex code writes a config.toml model_providers.vercel-ai-gateway block with base_url 'https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1', env_key 'AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY', and wire_api 'chat'. Keys starting with 'sk-' fall back to a direct OpenAI provider (base_url 'https://api.openai.com/v1', wire_api 'responses'), and any other prefix is rejected before any config is written.",
