    {
      "id": "claim_56293930c0f6492e9f261869b2788d76",
      "statement": "executeAgentInSandbox in lib/sandbox/agents/index.ts uses the temp-env-var pattern: it snapshots OPENAI_API_KEY, GEMINI_API_KEY, CURSOR_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY, GH_TOKEN, and GITHUB_TOKEN into originalEnv, overlays user-supplied apiKeys onto process.env for the duration of the dispatch, and restores the originals in a finally block so a per-user AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY cannot leak across concurrent tasks in the same Node process.",
